        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>瑞吉欧Reggio</title>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #111;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #1c1613;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  /* background photo placeholder occupying the whole page */\n  .placeholder.bg {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 540px;\n    height: 720px;\n    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(60,40,25,0.95), rgba(20,14,10,0.98));\n    color: #6b5a4a;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    padding: 6px;\n    z-index: 0;\n  }\n  .content {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n    padding: 40px 8px 20px 8px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 34px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 18px 0 30px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  p {\n    font-size: 17.5px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .u {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-decoration-color: #f5e04a;\n    text-decoration-style: wavy;\n    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;\n    text-underline-offset: 4px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"placeholder bg\">[Photo: background, wooden carved figurines on shelves behind glass, full page]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <h1>瑞吉欧Reggio</h1>\n\n    <p>● 基于皮亚杰和维果斯基等心理学家的<br>\n    <span class=\"u\">建构主义</span>心理学。</p>\n\n    <p>●<span class=\"u\">走进儿童心灵</span>的儿童观，以孩子的思维、<br>\n    孩子的立场来看待一场</p>\n\n    <p>不压制孩子，让其充分表现潜能</p>\n\n    <p>●弹性课程，从<span class=\"u\">儿童的兴趣和需要</span>出发</p>\n\n    <p>不让孩子生活在成人的包围之中。</p>\n\n    <p>●教师必须尽可能地<span class=\"u\">减少介入</span>，更不可过度介入。</p>\n\n    <p>与其牵着儿童的手，不如让他们用自己的双脚站立。</p>\n\n    <p>●儿童的<span class=\"u\">自我表达和相互交流</span>特别重要，是儿童探索、<br>\n    研究、解决问题过程中的基本活动。</p>\n\n    <p>●在<span class=\"u\">共同分享</span>中，每个人均可提出最好的想法，<br>\n    提升和加强团队间意见交流、<br>\n    并刺激新奇或出乎意料的事情发生。</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
